# In-copyright reference material — kept on disk, deliberately not tracked.
#
# reference/texts/additional/ holds private reference copies of works still under
# copyright (Campbell, Leiber, Bradbury, Jackson) plus the PDFs they were extracted
# from. Reading them locally is fine; committing them puts them in history, where a
# later `git push` would publish them and a rewrite would be needed to undo it.
#
# Harvey's "August Heat" in that folder IS public domain — move it to
# reference/texts/canon/ if you want it tracked.
reference/texts/additional/

